---
---

<section id="projects">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="reveal">
      <div class="sec-label" data-i18n="proj.label">Projects</div>
      <div class="sec-title" data-i18n="proj.title">Things I've built.</div>
    </div>
    <div class="proj-grid">

      <div class="proj-card reveal">
        <div class="proj-type" data-i18n="proj.type.kudms">Full-Stack · Document Workflow</div>
        <div class="proj-header">
          <div class="proj-name">KU·DMS — Document Approval System</div>
          <a class="proj-link" href="https://reg1.src.ku.ac.th/" target="_blank">Website ↗</a>
        </div>
        <div class="proj-desc" data-i18n="proj.desc.kudms">Thai-first document management and approval system for KU Sriracha student-organization
          projects. SvelteKit frontend on an ElysiaJS (Bun) API with PostgreSQL + Drizzle, role-based permissions,
          a multi-step approval workflow, and template-driven document rendering — deployed on the university's
          own servers behind nginx.</div>
        <div class="proj-tags">
          <span class="proj-tag">SvelteKit</span>
          <span class="proj-tag">ElysiaJS · Bun</span>
          <span class="proj-tag">PostgreSQL</span>
          <span class="proj-tag">Drizzle ORM</span>
          <span class="proj-tag">RBAC</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="proj-card reveal">
        <div class="proj-type" data-i18n="proj.type.kucoupon">Full-Stack · Web App</div>
        <div class="proj-header">
          <div class="proj-name">KU Coupon — E-Coupon Platform</div>
          <a class="proj-link" href="https://kupon.compaxtech.com/" target="_blank">Website ↗</a>
        </div>
        <div class="proj-desc" data-i18n="proj.desc.kucoupon">Built full-stack system using Express and PostgreSQL for 2,000+ users. Designed backend APIs and database schema, successfully reducing paper usage in campus events through a digital system.</div>
        <div class="proj-tags">
          <span class="proj-tag">Express</span>
          <span class="proj-tag">PostgreSQL</span>
          <span class="proj-tag">Full-Stack</span>
          <span class="proj-tag">API Design</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="proj-card reveal">
        <div class="proj-type" data-i18n="proj.type.kurun">Backend · Event Tracking</div>
        <div class="proj-header">
          <div class="proj-name">KURUN Check-in</div>
          <a class="proj-link" href="https://ku-run-check-in.compaxtech.com/" target="_blank">Website ↗</a>
        </div>
        <div class="proj-desc" data-i18n="proj.desc.kurun">Developed event tracking system with FastAPI and SQLAlchemy. Designed secure email-based verification system and automated activity validation using Strava data integration.</div>
        <div class="proj-tags">
          <span class="proj-tag">FastAPI</span>
          <span class="proj-tag">SQLAlchemy</span>
          <span class="proj-tag">Strava API</span>
          <span class="proj-tag">Backend</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="proj-card reveal">
        <div class="proj-type" data-i18n="proj.type.repdeco">Open Source · Backend</div>
        <div class="proj-header">
          <div class="proj-name">repdeco</div>
          <a class="proj-link" href="https://github.com/bell77m/repdeco" target="_blank">GitHub ↗</a>
        </div>
        <div class="proj-desc" data-i18n="proj.desc.repdeco">Python resilience decorator library published to PyPI. Exposes decorators for retry,
          timeout, circuit breaker, and fallback patterns — hardens flaky APIs and DB connections with zero
          boilerplate.</div>
        <div class="proj-tags">
          <span class="proj-tag">Python</span>
          <span class="proj-tag">PyPI</span>
          <span class="proj-tag">Open Source</span>
          <span class="proj-tag">Fault Tolerance</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="proj-card reveal">
        <div class="proj-type" data-i18n="proj.type.nlp">NLP · Machine Learning</div>
        <div class="proj-header">
          <div class="proj-name">Thai News Topic Modeling</div>
          <a class="proj-link" href="https://github.com/bell77m/Topic_modeling_thai_politic_news"
            target="_blank">GitHub ↗</a>
        </div>
        <div class="proj-desc" data-i18n="proj.desc.nlp">NLP pipeline on Thai political news — Thai word segmentation, LDA topic clustering, and
          content recommendation. Tackles Thai's no-whitespace tokenization challenge.</div>
        <div class="proj-tags">
          <span class="proj-tag">Python</span>
          <span class="proj-tag">LDA</span>
          <span class="proj-tag">NLP</span>
          <span class="proj-tag">Data Science</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="proj-card reveal">
        <div class="proj-type" data-i18n="proj.type.stegano">Python CLI · Software</div>
        <div class="proj-header">
          <div class="proj-name">AudioStegano</div>
          <a class="proj-link" href="https://github.com/bell77m/AudioStegano" target="_blank">GitHub ↗</a>
        </div>
        <div class="proj-desc" data-i18n="proj.desc.stegano">Hides and extracts secret payloads inside WAV files using LSB steganography. CLI
          supporting configurable bit-depth encode/decode.</div>
        <div class="proj-tags">
          <span class="proj-tag">Python</span>
          <span class="proj-tag">LSB Encoding</span>
          <span class="proj-tag">Signal Processing</span>
          <span class="proj-tag">CLI</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="proj-card reveal">
        <div class="proj-type" data-i18n="proj.type.gun">Embedded Systems · IoT</div>
        <div class="proj-header">
          <div class="proj-name">Gun Simulator Controller</div>
          <a class="proj-link" href="https://github.com/bell77m/Gun-Simulator" target="_blank">GitHub ↗</a>
        </div>
        <div class="proj-desc" data-i18n="proj.desc.gun">Physical gun-shaped PC controller on ESP32-S3 — RTOS firmware with interrupt-driven
          sensor I/O and Bluetooth HID pairing as a native input device.</div>
        <div class="proj-tags">
          <span class="proj-tag">ESP32-S3</span>
          <span class="proj-tag">Embedded C</span>
          <span class="proj-tag">RTOS</span>
          <span class="proj-tag">Bluetooth HID</span>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>
